        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric of brocaded silk, France, 1770s"@en , "Dress fabric of brocaded silk. With a pink ground with warp stripes in blue and a brocaded design of rose stems. The stems are pale blue and the roses are pink, mauve and tan. Brocaded tabby technique. Only the rose heads are brocaded, the stems are made by the ground weft."@en ;
